  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. <br>• Cut pumpkin into 1cm-thick wedges.<br>• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with <br>olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss <br>to coat.<br>• Roast for 15 minutes (it will finish roasting in <br>step 4!). <br>TIP: Peel the pumpkin, if preferred! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709912c30d33981f992d7c/step-e3e4b300.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic.<br>• In a medium saucepan, heat the butter over <br>medium heat. Cook half the garlic until fragrant, <br>1-2 minutes.<br>• Add the water and a generous pinch of salt, then <br>bring to the boil.<br>• Add jasmine rice. Stir, cover with a lid and reduce <br>heat to low. Cook for 10 minutes, then remove <br>from heat.<br>• Keep covered until rice is tender and water is <br>absorbed, 10 minutes. <br>TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so <br>don’t peek! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709912c30d33981f992d7c/step-3aef3510.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• While rice is cooking, roughly chop Asian greens.<br>• Trim baby broccoli. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709912c30d33981f992d7c/step-baefe020.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a small bowl, combine the soy sauce and honey.<br>• Drizzle roasted pumpkin with the honey-soy<br>mixture, then sprinkle with mixed sesame seeds.<br>• Roast pumpkin until golden and tender, a further <br>5-10 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709912c30d33981f992d7c/step-23162730.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• While the pumpkin is finishing, heat a large frying <br>pan over medium-high heat with sesame oil blend.<br>• Cook baby broccoli until just tender, 5-6 minutes.<br>• Add Asian greens, ginger paste and remaining <br>garlic and cook, stirring, until greens are slightly <br>wilted, 1-2 minutes.<br>• Season to taste, then remove from heat. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709912c30d33981f992d7c/step-0ca6d240.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide garlic rice between bowls. <br>• Top with ginger greens and honey-soy pumpkin, <br>spooning over any sauce from the oven tray. <br>• Drizzle over sesame dressing. <br>• Tear over coriander leaves to serve. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709912c30d33981f992d7c/step-674c0550.jpg"
    }
  ]
